## Configuration (wrangler.jsonc)

### Minimal Config

```jsonc
{
  "$schema": "./node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "my-worker",
  "main": "src/index.ts",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-03-18"
}
```

